 &lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/form&gt;</description></item><item><title>About Mish</title><link>https://mishochu.com/about/</link><pubDate>Thu, 11 Sep 2014 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://mishochu.com/about/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="hello"&gt;
 Hello
 &lt;a class="heading-link" href="#hello"&gt;
 &lt;i class="fa fa-link" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;
 &lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;My name&amp;rsquo;s Mish, well, sort of&amp;hellip;let&amp;rsquo;s just say it&amp;rsquo;s short for a seemingly easy
name which lot&amp;rsquo;s of people find ridiculously hard to pronounce.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I&amp;rsquo;ve had lot&amp;rsquo;s of practice though (what with it being my name) so I generally
explain it to others as if they were about eight. &amp;ldquo;It&amp;rsquo;s &amp;lsquo;Mish&amp;rsquo; like &amp;lsquo;fish&amp;rsquo;.&amp;rdquo;
Given that the phonetics of &lt;a href="http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ghoti"&gt;fish&lt;/a&gt; can
be confusing in their own right I guess it&amp;rsquo;s no surprise the ensuing difficulty.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>